The '''Seelos system''' was a [[star system]] located in the [[Kwymar sector]] of the [[Outer Rim Territories]].<ref name="Epic Battles" /> It contained the [[planet]] [[Seelos]], a [[desert]] world with great salt plains. Seelos was home to [[Captain]] [[Rex]] and [[Commander]]s [[Wolffe]] and [[Gregor]] during the [[Imperial Era|Age of the Empire]].<ref name="The Lost Commanders" />

